ggestions, streak counters, and progress milestones.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Security & Sharing",\n      "description": "Includes Face ID/PIN access, goal jar locking, gift links/QR codes for contributions, and group saving options for family goals.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#1DE9B6 (Teal)",\n    "secondary": "#FF6F61 (Coral)",\n    "accent": "#FFD600 (Yellow), #8E24AA (Purple)"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a colorful, cartoon-inspired design with rounded elements and soft shadows. The home dashboard uses illustrated piggy avatars for each savings goal, with progress bars and animated coin effects. Navigation is simple and icon-based, optimized for children and parents. Each screen uses vibrant backgrounds (teal, coral, yellow, purple) and playful illustrations. Key actions (add goal, play game, transfer money) are highlighted with accent colors and large, tappable buttons. Parental controls and learning content are accessible via a bottom navigation bar."\n}'}",
